<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-E.P. 17-0 VS BOLAND, NEED 180 TOTAL TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-E.P. 17-0 VS BOLAND, NEED 180 TOTAL TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province need a further 163</p>
<p>runs for victory after finishing on 17 without loss in their</p>
<p>second innings on the third day of their Supersport Series match</p>
<p>against Boland in Paarl on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Boland captain Adrian Kuiper (82) shared a fifth wicket</p>
<p>stand of 121 with Andrew Wylie (61) but his side were still</p>
<p>dismissed for 237 in their second innings after resuming at two</p>
<p>without loss on the third morning.</p>
<p>Kuiper's innings spanned 157 balls and contained six</p>
<p>boundaries and two sixes while Wylie faced 174 deliveries in a</p>
<p>patient stay that has given Boland an outside chance of victory</p>
<p>if they can claim early wickets on the fourth morning.</p>
<p>Boland first innings 204 </p>
<p>Eastern Province first innings 262</p>
<p>Boland second innings</p>
<p>    L.Ferreira lbw b Shaw			9</p>
<p>    A.Wessels run out			    2</p>
<p>    W.Truter c and b Shaw		     19</p>
<p>    K.Jackson c Koen b Callaghan	     7</p>
<p>    A.Kuiper b Callaghan			82</p>
<p>    A.Wylie c and b Badenhorst		61</p>
<p>    M.Brink c Rushmere b Shaw		  2</p>
<p>    C.Henderson not out			 28</p>
<p>    C.Vorster b Baptiste			 1</p>
<p>    H.Williams b Baptiste			3</p>
<p>    J.Albanie run out			    3</p>
<p>    Extras					  20</p>
<p>    Total (all out in 92 overs)	    237</p>
<p>Bowling: Baptiste 24-9-49-2, Badenhorst 15-2-45-1, Shaw</p>
<p>26-10-52-3, Callaghan 14-5-22-2, Birrell 13-1-53-0</p>
<p>Eastern Province second innings</p>
<p>    M.Beamish not out			 7</p>
<p>    C.Bradfield not out		     4</p>
<p>    Extras					6</p>
<p>Total (for no wicket in 12 overs)  17</p>
<p>Bowling: Williams 4-1-6-0, Albanie 3-1-3-0, Henderson</p>
<p>4-2-2-0, Kuiper 1-0-1-0.</p>
